        "original_id": "f4971696-a5d4-50ab-ad97-178e9afe87d2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Discwoman\n- People: Seyi Adebanjo\n- Places: New York, New York City, Nigeria\n- Concepts: genderqueer, genderfluid, queer, gender expression, electronic music community\n- Roles: collective, booking agency, event platform, MFA media artist\n\nFacts:\n- Discwoman is a New York-based collective, booking agency, and event platform in the electronic music community.\n- Discwoman represents and showcases female-identified talent, including cis women, transwomen, and genderqueer people.\n- Genderqueer people may express a combination of masculinity and femininity, or neither, in their gender expression.\n- Seyi Adebanjo was born in Nigeria and now lives in New York City.\n- Seyi Adebanjo is a genderfluid, queer MFA media artist.",
